 "description": "Gotta get ready for Origins. I'm gonna go down, but I want to win at least one game.",
 "strategy": "-Rescue Leia as fast as possible using 8d8.  If they are blockading at the D-bay just walk the droid past and deploy Jar Jar at the detention Corridor. Make sure you can send some expendable troops to fight your way back.\n\n-Once she is back keep her in the War room draining for 2 every turn. Keep Deneb both with her so that all that will come from their force pile.\n\n-This is the point where if they come after you, then attack with all you have. If they stay away spread and drain.\n\n-Use Figrin D'an for small bits of retreival\n\n-Get Han and a scout together to cancel BD's\n\n-If you need to keep Your people from being battled at an interior site (a.k.a. Leia and Jar Jar at DS: DC waiting for reinforcements) the put them on one of the fambas.",
